        "title": "Incorporating physical source parameters into microlensing modeling",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.20555v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-06-18T17:58:54Z",
        "description": "Modeling of complex microlensing events suffers from many difficult-to-disentangle degeneracies. This is especially the case for orbital motion of the source in a binary system, the so-called xallarap effect. To address the degeneracies inherent in xallarap modeling, we developed a novel approach th",
        "title_cn": "将物理源参数纳入微透镜建模"
      },
