        "description": "We study the problem of learning local Lindbladians from black-box access to the physical evolution, and the goal is to estimate all Hamiltonian and dissipative coefficients. We give an algorithm built directly from finite-time channel probes, which runs the unknown evolution for short times, estima",
        "title_cn": "本地Lindbladians的近似最佳学习体验"
      },
      {
